Every 3 seconds calls down a Blizzard on the largest group of enemy units within 800: 6 waves of ice shards, one every 0.5 seconds, hurting every enemy unit under it. It leaves the ground frozen for 20 seconds, and every enemy unit on frozen ground is slowed. A Blizzard that falls on frozen ground hits twice as hard, and the frost there spreads wider and lasts another 20 seconds, up to twice as wide.

Damage: |cffffcc006 x 40|r, |cffffcc006 x 80|r on frozen ground
Slow: |cffffcc00-50% movement speed|r on frozen ground
Cooldown: |cffffcc003s|r
Range: |cffffcc00800|r
Area of effect: |cffffcc00200|r (Blizzard), |cffffcc00200 - 400|r (frozen ground)
Duration: |cffffcc0020s|r (frozen ground)
Targets: |cffffcc00air & ground|r
Damage type: |cffffcc00spell|r
}

